# DERIVED by tools/classify_silent.py -- do not hand-edit.
# Why each template named on reachable.psv's silent_templates line
# never fires from a pair of natural shelf rows.
# template | label | slots | witness_cost | witness | blocker |
#   evidence
#
# no-substrate            no species the shelf holds or can make
#                         matches one of its reactant slots -- or one
#                         matches only as a substructure and the
#                         rewrite that follows is impossible. The
#                         blocker names EVERY such slot, because a
#                         template short of two substrates is not
#                         unblocked by sourcing one of them.
# needs-more-than-a-pair  every slot is matched, and satisfying them
#                         all costs three or more sources, or a
#                         condition the sweep holds fixed
#                         (cell_potential=0).
# cannot-fire             a flask the sweep ALREADY HELD matched every
#                         slot and yielded nothing. The group worth
#                         taking first.
#
# A witness is the cheapest set of TIERS matching every slot, searched
# exhaustively to 4, then BUILT: the network is the arbiter and the
# SMARTS match only the candidate. There are three kinds of tier:
#
#   <row>      one natural shelf row's own species.
#   closure    the rows whose species are all under 9 heavy atoms, in
#              one flask, expanded to a FIXPOINT. Counts as ONE source
#              however many rows built it, so a witness naming it is
#              above a pair by construction and is never 'cannot-fire'.
#   <row>@1    that row PLUS the closure, expanded ONE generation. Two
#              sources. Bounded, not closed: step_frontier below is
#              not zero, so a 'cannot make' that had to look here is an
#              estimate at one step. A whole-shelf closure is not
#              available -- the sugars cap a flask in the first round.
#
# pool_unpriceable is the species an expansion discovered and the
# thermochemistry then refused to price -- an ion with no measured
# pKa, mostly. They are not in the pool: a flask cannot be CHARGED
# with one, and nothing can react with what has no standard state.
#! needs-more-than-a-pair = 10
#! no-substrate = 21
#! silent = 31
#! closure_rows = 24
#! closure_species = 50
#! closure_frontier = 0
#! step_rows = 13
#! step_frontier = 304
#! pool_species = 325
#! pool_unpriceable = 0
#
# THE WORK ORDER: one missing substrate holds several
# templates, so the queue is this list and not the 31.
# 'blocked' is how many templates name this slot; 'alone' is how
# many name it and nothing else, so 'alone' is what sourcing it
# would unblock.
#! blocking_substrates = 24
#! substrates_that_unblock_alone = 18
#   2 blocked, 2 alone  [OX2H1][N+](=[O])[O-]
#      aromatic_nitration, nitrate_esterification
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [C;H4]
#      steam_reforming
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [CH2X3]=[CX2]=[OX1]
#      ketene_acid_addition
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [CH2]=[CH1][C]#[N]
#      alkene_hydrodimerisation
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [CH2]=[CH2]
#      wacker_oxidation
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [CH3][CX3](=[O])[OX2][CX3]=[O]
#      perkin_condensation
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [CX2]#[CX2]
#      alkyne_hydration
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [CX3;-1]
#      carbanion_alkylation
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [CX4;H4]
#      methane_ammoxidation
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [CX4H2]([CX3](=[O])[OX2H1])[CX3](=[O])[OX2H1]
#      knoevenagel_doebner_condensation
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [N;H0]=[O]
#      nitric_oxide_reoxidation
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [NX3;H2][CX3]=[OX1]
#      amide_methylolation
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [OX1]=[SX3](=[OX1])=[OX1]
#      sulfur_trioxide_hydration
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [OX2H][CH2][C;H1;@,@@]1[OX2][C;H1;@,@@]([OX2H])[C;H1;@,@@]([OX2H])[C;H1;@,@@]1[OX2H]
#      aldofuranose_dehydration
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [OX2H][CH2][c]1[cH][cH][c]([CH]=[O])[o]1
#      hydroxymethylfurfural_rehydration
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [S,N,P;+0,+1](=[O])[OX2H1]
#      mineral_oxyacid_dissociation
#   1 blocked, 1 alone  [c][N+](=[O])[O-]
#      nitro_hydrogenation
#   1 blocked, 0 alone  [C;H2]=[C;H1][C;H1]=[O;+0]
#      skraup_cyclisation
#   1 blocked, 0 alone  [CX2;H1]#[NX1]
#      cyanide_imine_addition
#   1 blocked, 0 alone  [CX3](=[O])[OX2][CX3]=[O]
#      n_acylation
#   1 blocked, 0 alone  [CX3]=[NX2;H1]
#      cyanide_imine_addition
#   1 blocked, 0 alone  [N;H2;+0][c]1[c;H1][c][c][c][c]1
#      skraup_cyclisation
#   1 blocked, 0 alone  [NX3;H1,H2;!$(N[#6]=[O,S,N])]
#      n_acylation
#   1 blocked, 0 alone  [O;+0]=[N;+1]([O;-1])[c]1[c][c][c][c][c]1
#      skraup_cyclisation
#
alcohol_halide_substitution | needs-more-than-a-pair | 2 | 1 | closure |  | fires on the closure, which is 24 rows, and 0 row(s) of its own
aldofuranose_dehydration | no-substrate | 1 | 0 |  | [OX2H][CH2][C;H1;@,@@]1[OX2][C;H1;@,@@]([OX2H])[C;H1;@,@@]([OX2H])[C;H1;@,@@]1[OX2H] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
alkene_hydrodimerisation | no-substrate | 3 | 0 |  | [CH2]=[CH1][C]#[N] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
alkyne_hydration | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [CX2]#[CX2] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
allylic_ammoxidation | needs-more-than-a-pair | 3 | 2 | alpha-pinene+closure |  | fires on the closure, which is 24 rows, and 1 row(s) of its own
amide_methylolation | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [NX3;H2][CX3]=[OX1] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
aromatic_nitration | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [OX2H1][N+](=[O])[O-] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
cannizzaro_disproportionation | needs-more-than-a-pair | 3 | 2 | lignin-monomer-coniferyl@1 |  | reachable only above a pair (lignin-monomer-coniferyl@1), and then the template applies and the rewrite is discarded: 1 product species cannot be priced
carbanion_alkylation | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [CX3;-1] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
cyanide_imine_addition | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [CX3]=[NX2;H1] + [CX2;H1]#[NX1] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
hydroformylation_branched | needs-more-than-a-pair | 3 | 2 | closure+eugenol |  | fires on the closure, which is 24 rows, and 1 row(s) of its own
hydroformylation_linear | needs-more-than-a-pair | 3 | 2 | closure+eugenol |  | fires on the closure, which is 24 rows, and 1 row(s) of its own
hydroxymethylfurfural_rehydration | no-substrate | 3 | 0 |  | [OX2H][CH2][c]1[cH][cH][c]([CH]=[O])[o]1 | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
intramolecular_williamson | needs-more-than-a-pair | 2 | 2 | cellulose-unit@1 |  | fires on cellulose-unit@1 -- a row expanded one generation against the closure's 24 rows
ketene_acid_addition | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [CH2X3]=[CX2]=[OX1] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
ketofuranose_dehydration | needs-more-than-a-pair | 1 | 2 | sucrose@1 |  | fires on sucrose@1 -- a row expanded one generation against the closure's 24 rows
knoevenagel_doebner_condensation | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [CX4H2]([CX3](=[O])[OX2H1])[CX3](=[O])[OX2H1] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
kolbe_schmitt_carboxylation | needs-more-than-a-pair | 2 | 2 | eugenol@1 |  | reachable only above a pair (eugenol@1), and then the template applies and the rewrite is discarded: 1 product species cannot be priced
methane_ammoxidation | no-substrate | 3 | 0 |  | [CX4;H4] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
mineral_oxyacid_dissociation | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [S,N,P;+0,+1](=[O])[OX2H1] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
n_acylation | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [NX3;H1,H2;!$(N[#6]=[O,S,N])] + [CX3](=[O])[OX2][CX3]=[O] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
nitrate_esterification | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [OX2H1][N+](=[O])[O-] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
nitric_oxide_reoxidation | no-substrate | 3 | 1 | closure | [N;H0]=[O] | no rewrite survives: the pool matches it only inside a larger molecule
nitro_hydrogenation | no-substrate | 4 | 0 |  | [c][N+](=[O])[O-] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
perkin_condensation | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [CH3][CX3](=[O])[OX2][CX3]=[O] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
skraup_cyclisation | no-substrate | 8 | 0 |  | [N;H2;+0][c]1[c;H1][c][c][c][c]1 + [C;H2]=[C;H1][C;H1]=[O;+0] + [O;+0]=[N;+1]([O;-1])[c]1[c][c][c][c][c]1 | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
steam_reforming | no-substrate | 2 | 0 |  | [C;H4] | nothing the shelf holds or can make matches it
sulfur_dioxide_oxidation_by_nitrogen_dioxide | needs-more-than-a-pair | 3 | 1 | closure |  | reachable only above a pair (closure), and then the template applies and the rewrite is discarded: 1 product species cannot be priced
